    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Motorola's first phone you could carry was a brick. Why?",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.77,
        "window": 4.17,
        "fill": 0.904
      },
      {
        "scene": "weeks",
        "text": "Its engineers had just 6 weeks to build one, to show America's phone regulators.",
        "start": 4.47,
        "seconds": 5.55,
        "window": 6.07,
        "fill": 0.914
      },
      {
        "scene": "parts",
        "text": "Everything had to fit in one hand: a radio, an antenna, and a battery to power them.",
        "start": 10.53,
        "seconds": 5.64,
        "window": 6.13,
        "fill": 0.92
      },
      {
        "scene": "waves",
        "text": "How does it call with no wire? The radio turns your voice into radio waves for a tower nearby.",
        "start": 16.67,
        "seconds": 6.35,
        "window": 6.97,
        "fill": 0.911
      },
      {
        "scene": "cells",
        "text": "Each tower covers one small patch, a cell. That's the cell in cell phone.",
        "start": 23.63,
        "seconds": 4.92,
        "window": 5.33,
        "fill": 0.923
      },
      {
        "scene": "call",
        "text": "In April of 1973 it made a real call, on a New York street.",
        "start": 28.97,
        "seconds": 5.27,
        "window": 5.73,
        "fill": 0.92
      },
      {
        "scene": "shop",
        "text": "But that phone wasn't for sale. The first one you could buy weighed 785 grams, and was 300 millimetres long.",
        "start": 34.7,
        "seconds": 8.57,
        "window": 9.07,
        "fill": 0.945
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "Getting that brick into a shop took over $100M of Motorola's money, and more than 10 years.",
        "start": 43.77,
        "seconds": 7.1,
        "window": 7.77,
        "fill": 0.914
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "All of that, for a phone that fit in one hand.",
        "start": 51.53,
        "seconds": 2.86,
        "window": 3.3,
        "fill": 0.867
      }
    ]
  },
